{
  "name": "dsh-continuechat",
  "version": "0.1.2",
  "description": "Manually resume an interrupted DeepSeek Harness conversation: when a turn stopped by hand, by a network or provider failure, or by the output-token limit, one command picks the run up exactly where it stopped. | 手动继续被中断的 DSH 对话：当轮次因手动停止、网络或模型请求失败、输出 token 上限而中断时，一条命令即可从断点续跑。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "README.zh.md"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "continue",
    "resume",
    "interrupted",
    "retry"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "CaiBai-Fish",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/CaiBai-Fish/dsh-continuechat.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/CaiBai-Fish/dsh-continuechat#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/CaiBai-Fish/dsh-continuechat/issues"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22"
  }
}
